OL,3,GNEWSAResidents raise lorry safety fears
OL,4,Aon estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents on a new-build estate in
OL,7,FLeicestershire have raised concerns
OL,8,Fsomebody could be seriously injured
OL,9,Famid a "steep increase" in lorries
OL,10,Fpassing through the development.
OL,12,FMore trucks have started to pass
OL,13,Fthrough Oadby due to work on the latest
OL,14,Fphase of housing at the Cottage Farm
OL,15,Festate.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
