OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787808398
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents raise lorry safety fears
OL,4,Aon estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who live in the area claimed
OL,7,Fthey had seen some vehicles travelling
OL,8,Fover 30mph (48km/h), which had caused
OL,9,Fhomes to shake. One resident claimed
OL,10,Fthere had "almost been a handful of
OL,11,Fcollisions with children" in
OL,12,Fplaygrounds.
OL,14,FBloor Homes, which is behind the
OL,15,Fproject at Cottage Farm, apologised for
OL,16,Fany inconvenience caused by the work,
OL,17,Fadding a 5mph (8km/h) limit was in
OL,18,Fplace during the work.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
